    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d730">

                <pb facs="0833" n="821" sameAs="frus:frus1943v02/pg821"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">740.00112 European War 1939/9629: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Minister in Sweden</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Johnson</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1943-11-24T17:00:00-04:00">November 24,
                            1943—5 p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1278. Embassy in London has been instructed by Department and FEA to repeat its
                    telegram 7898, November 12 to Department to you together with our reply.<anchor
                        n="19" xml:id="d730-f1"/> These communications outline proposed <pb
                        facs="0834" n="822" xml:id="pg822"/> joint protest by you and British
                    colleague on high iron ore export rate during 1943. Unless you see most
                    important reasons making action unwise you are requested to deliver the proposed
                    memorandum to the Swedes as soon as the text from London is received and
                    parallel instructions have been received by the British Minister. Your action in
                    this matter should be reported.</p>
                <p>Reference your 3539 of October 29 and 3733 of November 16.<anchor n="20"
                        xml:id="d730-f2"/>
                </p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d730-f1" n="19" xml:id="d730-f1-content">
                <p>Telegrams No. 7898, November 12, 9 p.m., and No. 7367, November 20, midnight,
                        <ref target="#pg816">pp. 816</ref> and <ref target="#pg819">819</ref>,
                    respectively.</p>
            </note>
